==Schedule==
The schedule is the same in both Japanese and English version. On odd days, ''Facing Danger'' appears on the first 12 hours. On even days, ''Facing Danger'' appears on the second 12 hours (at 11:59 so it doesn't pass onto the next day).

*2nd day: 11:59 - 23:59
*5th day: 0:00 - 12:00
*8th day: 11:59 - 23:59
*11th day: 0:00 - 12:00
*14th day: 11:59 -23:59
*17th day: 0:00 - 12:00
*20th day: 11:59 - 23:59
*23rd day: 0:00 -12:00
*26th day: 11:59 -23:59
*29th day: 0:00 - 12:00

It is also available as a [[Catamin Stages|Catamin Stage]] for 2 Catamins C and can be cleared up to two times per day.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 6.7 Update|Version 6.7]], Facing Danger had no limit on how many times it could be cleared per appearance, making [[Cat Energy|energy]] the only limiting factor in one's ability to farm it. The drop rewards at the time were a 70% chance for 1 [[Cat Capsule|Cat Ticket]] and a 30% chance for 2 Cat Tickets; they were increased by 1 each to make up for the reduced farmability.
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Steel Visage costs 300 [[Cat Energy|energy]], has no clear limit and drops 2 or 3 Rare Cat Tickets. However, it is only available for 1 hour at a time.

